SUMMARY:🍂💛 HEART OF GRATITUDE💛🍂   Sound Bath for Joy\, Connect
 ion & Inner Harmony
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\nAs November invites us 
 to slow down and appreciate life's simple blessings\, join me for a deeply
  immersive\, full-body sound and vibrational experience designed to nouris
 h your heart and restore your inner harmony. ![✨](https://static.xx.fbcd
 n.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t75/2/16/2728.png)\nImagine a warm golden light 
 glowing within your heart\, gently expanding with each wave of sound. Allo
 w yourself to reconnect with the people\, moments\, and blessings that bri
 ng meaning to your life. Let the soothing vibrations wash away stress and 
 create space for greater peace\, appreciation\, and joy. ![💖](https://s
 tatic.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t88/2/16/1f496.png)\nGive yourself 
 the gift of an hour to pause\, receive\, and reconnect with the goodness a
 lready present in your life.\n![🗓️](https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/image
 s/emoji.php/v9/tfb/2/16/1f5d3.png) Sunday\, November 15th\n\n![⏰](https:
 //static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tb5/2/16/23f0.png) 4:00–5:00 P
 M\n![📍](https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tcc/2/16/1f4cd.
 png) Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n2 Science of Mind Way\, Ashevi
 lle\, NC\n![✨](https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t75/2/16/
 2728.png) What to bring:\n\n![🧘](https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emo
 ji.php/v9/t84/2/16/1f9d8.png) Yoga mat\n![🛏️](https://static.xx.fbcdn
 .net/images/emoji.php/v9/t50/2/16/1f6cf.png) Pillow and blanket\n![😌](h
 ttps://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t20/2/16/1f60c.png) An eye 
 mask (optional\, for deeper relaxation)\n![💛](https://static.xx.fbcdn.n
 et/images/emoji.php/v9/tb4/2/16/1f49b.png) Sliding scale: $10–$20\n\nPle
 ase arrive 15 minutes early to get comfortable and claim your spot. Seatin
 g and spaces are first come\, first served.\nLet the healing sounds and ge
 ntle vibrations surround you with peace and tranquility as you open your h
 eart to gratitude and the beauty of the present moment. ![🌿](https://st
 atic.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tbd/2/16/1f33f.png)\n![✨](https://
 static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t75/2/16/2728.png) Come as you are
 . Leave feeling nourished\, peaceful\, and connected.\nI look forward to s
 haring this beautiful experience with you!\n[#SerenitySoundHealing](https:
 //www.facebook.com/hashtag/serenitysoundhealing?__cft__[0]=AZjxZET6cGz1TmZ
 h2HB41tGlIj0z5KLpqG8O4FbXDXtw_dYy5XPcg9myX9Yt-CQHYElaeLUzb0sp9RSpjCZGzg65i
 MG21PcXHJrrwY21bImp9brfs844MQBt2r6Km3GptHiB&__tn__=q) [#AshevilleNC](https
 ://www.facebook.com/hashtag/ashevillenc?__cft__[0]=AZjxZET6cGz1TmZh2HB41tG
 lIj0z5KLpqG8O4FbXDXtw_dYy5XPcg9myX9Yt-CQHYElaeLUzb0sp9RSpjCZGzg65iMG21PcXH
 JrrwY21bImp9brfs844MQBt2r6Km3GptHiB&__tn__=q) [#SoundBath](https://www.fac
 ebook.com/hashtag/soundbath?__cft__[0]=AZjxZET6cGz1TmZh2HB41tGlIj0z5KLpqG8
 O4FbXDXtw_dYy5XPcg9myX9Yt-CQHYElaeLUzb0sp9RSpjCZGzg65iMG21PcXHJrrwY21bImp9
 brfs844MQBt2r6Km3GptHiB&__tn__=q) [#Gratitude](https://www.facebook.com/ha
 shtag/gratitude?__cft__[0]=AZjxZET6cGz1TmZh2HB41tGlIj0z5KLpqG8O4FbXDXtw_dY
 y5XPcg9myX9Yt-CQHYElaeLUzb0sp9RSpjCZGzg65iMG21PcXHJrrwY21bImp9brfs844MQBt2
 r6Km3GptHiB&__tn__=q) [#HeartHealing](https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/hea
 rthealing?__cft__[0]=AZjxZET6cGz1TmZh2HB41tGlIj0z5KLpqG8O4FbXDXtw_dYy5XPcg
 9myX9Yt-CQHYElaeLUzb0sp9RSpjCZGzg65iMG21PcXHJrrwY21bImp9brfs844MQBt2r6Km3G
 ptHiB&__tn__=q)[#InnerHarmony](https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/innerharmo
 ny?__cft__[0]=AZjxZET6cGz1TmZh2HB41tGlIj0z5KLpqG8O4FbXDXtw_dYy5XPcg9myX9Yt
 -CQHYElaeLUzb0sp9RSpjCZGzg65iMG21PcXHJrrwY21bImp9brfs844MQBt2r6Km3GptHiB&_
 _tn__=q) [#SelfCare](https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/selfcare?__cft__[0]=
